  ('zcrm_5797994000003481047', 'Kara', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of a sustainability risk and compliance platform designed to transform unstructured non-financial data into structured, audit-ready disclosures aligned with regulatory frameworks. The company offers automated data collection and analysis capabilities, enabling financial institutions and their affiliated companies, reduced manual effort, improved data quality, and lower compliance costs.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:28:16', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481070', 'TOGFashion', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of a fashion-sharing platform designed to enable people to share their clothes and accessories. The company offers a gamified platform, enabling fashion enthusiasts to connect, borrow, sell, and inspire each other, fostering a sustainable and stylish community.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:29:28', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481093', 'BioBond Adhesives', 'PediaMetrix', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A N/A', 'Developer of sustainable materials technology designed to transform the coatings and adhesives industry toward environmentally friendly alternatives. The company''s technology offers petroleum-free, microplastic-free and non-toxic formulations, enabling manufacturers and industrial users to reduce emissions and advance a safer, circular materials economy.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:30:53', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481116', 'Old West Water', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of sustainable materials technology designed to transform the coatings and adhesives industry toward environmentally friendly alternatives. The company''s technology offers petroleum-free, microplastic-free and non-toxic formulations, enabling manufacturers and industrial users to reduce emissions and advance a safer, circular materials economy.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:31:28', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481139', 'Gradient GEothermal', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Operator of a geothermal energy firm intended to transition existing oil and gas wellbores into clean, baseload power generators by extracting thermal energy and integrating off-the-shelf, modular power generation units. The company deploys modular geothermal power units in oil and gas basins across to generate clean electricity, reduce operating expenses and provide consistent power, provide baseload power, and eliminate surface disturbance by utilizing existing infrastructure, enabling oil and gas sectors to generate baseload, renewable power while minimizing environmental disturbance and risk.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:33:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481162', 'Brick', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of an AI-powered energy optimization platform designed to use reinforcement learning to reduce power waste in buildings, data centers, factories, and EV infrastructure. The company''s platform integrates with existing systems like HVAC and lighting and autonomously manages them in real time using a proprietary RL engine that adapts to factors like occupancy, weather, and grid conditions, helping businesses, governments, and communities thrive by transforming energy waste into opportunity, profitability, and sustainability.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:34:25', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481185', 'Carbon Free Earth', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of building materials and carbon capture products designed to promote sustainability and reduce greenhouse gas emissions. The company offers products for use in precast building products, roof tiles, pavers, and wallboard, helping the construction and architecture markets to balance environmental impact while facilitating innovative building practices.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:35:05', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481208', 'Applied Biorefinery Services', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of building materials and carbon capture products designed to promote sustainability and reduce greenhouse gas emissions. The company offers products for use in precast building products, roof tiles, pavers, and wallboard, helping the construction and architecture markets to balance environmental impact while facilitating innovative building practices.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:35:51', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481231', 'Lectorlyst', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of an electrochemical technology intended to reduce carbon emissions and create a more sustainable chemical production. The company''s technology converts carbon dioxide waste into a range of useful chemicals for various industries, enabling clients to reduce their environmental impact, use sustainable sources for essential chemicals, and minimize reliance on fossil fuels.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:36:53', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481254', 'Skyhook Solar', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of Solar Stations, bike docks, and battery charge vault products designed to accelerate the global transition to clean energy. The company engages in EV charging and Micromobility battery charging using solar, enabling clients to deploy charging infrastructure rapidly and cost-effectively.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:37:45', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481277', 'Honua Resources', 'Align Trade', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N A', 'Operator of a geothermal energy company intended to integrate new assets into the geothermal landscape to unlock the Earth''s potential for green energy. The company applies data analysis, modelling, simulations and monitoring tools as well as engineering and geoscience, artificial intelligence and machine learning, blockchain, and the Internet of Things to the clean energy extraction process.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:38:35', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481300', 'KAT Innovation', NULL, 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of a non-invasive smart garment designed to promote bone formation and address osteopenia and osteoporosis. The company offers integrated electrostimulation and intelligent app-based monitoring, enabling individuals at risk of bone loss, improved mobility, adherence, and reduction in fracture-related injuries.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:39:22', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481321', 'WATTER', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of water heating technology device designed to net zero compute system for a sustainable future. The company''s device uses the waste heat from powerful computing devices to heat the water in people''s homes and leverages AI to define the optimal hot water and then utilize energy to generate money, enabling users to turn water heating into a smart, self-sustaining investment, and reshape everyday energy use.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:40:26', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481344', 'REON Technologies', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Provider of safe, reliable, and affordable energy storage services intended to democratize global energy storage by offering affordable systems. The company provides intelligent, reliable, and accessible energy storage and microgrid solutions that accelerate the global adoption of renewable energy, its technology leveraging AI to optimize system performance through customized power management of batteries and PV panels, enabling organizations to maximize return on investment and carbon footprint reduction.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:41:20', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481367', 'Aeris Evolution', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Manufacturer of a modular commercial aircraft designed to accelerate the integration of new technologies and improve efficiency in aviation. The company offers aircraft that are easier to develop, certify, and produce, configured for in-service upgrades, enabling airlines to manage operating costs, enhance fleet flexibility, and expand passenger access to air travel.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:57:17', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481390', 'Maelstrom Molecules', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Provider of radical solutions intended to redefine the fight against plastic pollution. The company is a circular oil producer that uses proprietary kinetic conversion technology to process end-of-life plastic into circular crude oil used for the manufacture of recycled, renewable virgin plastics in legacy refining and petrochemical assets, enabling people to help reduce the carbon footprint.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 18:59:51', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481413', 'APT Solar Solutions', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Provider of advanced solar services intended for high-efficiency power generation in compact urban spaces. The company utilizes three-dimensional solar modules arranged in vertical arrays, offering superior performance with a full-sky view, low maintenance, scalability, and retrofit options for existing infrastructure, enabling residential areas and farms with cost-effective solar energy adoption in dense, off-grid, while reducing land and grid extension costs.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 19:01:03', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481436', 'Bizztech', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of a technology platform designed to transform digital twins into intelligent, sustainable, and operational ecosystems. The company offers a metaverse layer with immersive 3D simulation and an Agentic AI layer for real-time autonomous decision-making, enabling manufacturers, municipalities, and urban planners enhanced design precision, operational efficiency, and improved quality of life in smart environments.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 19:02:02', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481459', 'C+UP', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'The company offers a patented single-step electrochemical process that produces energy-dense, infrastructure-ready propane for use in heating, transportation, and aviation fuel, serving hard-to-abate sectors such as ethanol, steel, and chemicals, enabling decarbonization through cost-effective and scalable carbon reuse.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 19:02:41', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481482', 'Gridflow', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Operator of an energy storage company intended to manufacture a lithium-ion flow battery. The company''s technology separates sulfur into a liquid reservoir capable of providing electricity for more hours for safer, longer-lasting, and more affordable energy storage, enabling users to store energy in tightly packed layers, making them prone to thermal runaway.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 19:03:34', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003481505', 'Oiler Tech', 'Virtu AI', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'N/A', 'Developer of methane emissions technology intended to develop economically viable and easily scalable solutions for detection and quantification of methane emissions. The company combines edge and cloud computation along with optical gas imaging (OGI) cameras to continuously detect invisible gas leaks in real-time with the help of vision algorithms, thereby enabling oil and gas companies to reduce operational cost, increase safety and comply with regulations', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2025', 'Pitchbook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Jordan Middlebrooks', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-05 19:04:14', '2026-01-05 14:50:19', '2026-01-05 14:50:19'),
