  ('zcrm_5797994000003653951', 'Pontoro', 'Pontoro', 'Jackson Key', 'Antonio V.', 'Operator of a digital asset securitization and liquidity platform intended to address the shortfall in infrastructure debt financing and limited investor access. The company''s platform integrates technical, legal, and regulatory protocols to convert traditionally illiquid fund interests into liquid investments, thereby increasing capital flows and participation, enabling investors with liquidity, transparency and customization to private fund participants, access, and customization for limited partners while increasing efficiency and creating new distribution opportunities.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'CrunchBase', 'Reached Out', 'Jackson Key', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-02 14:24:11', '2026-02-02 14:24:12', '2026-02-02 14:24:12'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003653986', 'Old Well Labs', 'Old Well Labs', 'Jackson Key', 'Campbell Wilson', 'OWL (Old Well Labs) is a Charlotte-based financial intelligence platform that centralizes fragmented institutional data to provide transparency into the $12 trillion allocator market. Founded in 2022 by former endowment professionals Campbell Wilson, Zak May, and Megan White, the company offers a comprehensive repository of analytics for over 15,000 global fund managers and maps the portfolios of more than 7,000 allocators, including major university endowments and foundations. By utilizing AI to track team changes, service provider shifts, and real-time news across 1.4 million professional profiles, OWL enables institutional investors to discover new fund launches and monitor existing holdings with high-precision filtering. Currently at the Series A stage with approximately $5 million in total funding, the platform is used by prominent offices like Makena Capital and Hall Capital to streamline manager discovery and institutional oversight.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jackson Key', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-02 15:02:05', '2026-02-02 15:02:05', '2026-02-02 15:02:05'),
