  ('zcrm_5797994000003661077', 'Midship', 'Midship', 'Soham Shah', 'Aahel Iyer', 'Developer of Artificial Intelligence (AI) based audit automation software designed for internal control testing and compliance review. The company''s platform analyzes risk and control matrices, identifies automatable controls, ingests and classifies control evidence, executes audit procedures through autonomous agents, and links test results to source documentation, enabling clients to perform testing, IT general control reviews, and financial process audits with reduced manual effort, consistent documentation, and improved audit efficiency.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 19:19:05', '2026-02-03 19:21:35', '2026-02-03 19:21:35'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661112', 'Datatruck', 'Datatruck', 'Soham Shah', 'Ulugbek Ergashev', 'Developer of workforce automation and fleet management software designed for fleet owners in the commercial trucking industry. The company''s platform combines load management, management accounting, and decision intelligence to provide the tools to drive business success effortlessly and help clients to improve data security, reconcile and audit, save costs, decrease order-to-cash cycle, decrease downtime, and increase utilization and offers services like data analytics-as-a-service, transport management system, and data visibility, enabling clients to achieve their business goals efficiently.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 19:21:23', '2026-02-03 19:21:24', '2026-02-03 19:21:24'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661139', 'CVector', 'CVector', 'Soham Shah', 'Richard Zhang', 'Operator of an industrial data analytics and optimization platform intended to bridge live control data from industrial sites for energy optimization. The company''s platform empowers emerging climate technology projects to thrive by connecting them with high-fidelity, real-time data that helps troubleshoot equipment, optimize facility performance and adapt to external factors such as renewable energy availability and grid prices, enabling operators to make transformative operational and commercial decisions through the use of virtual operators and techno-economic models.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 19:23:33', '2026-02-03 19:23:33', '2026-02-03 19:23:33'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661174', 'Yipy', 'Yipy', 'Soham Shah', 'Adam Tuttle', 'Developer of an end-to-end brand management platform designed to empower businesses in the hospitality industry to improve quality standards. The company offers a comprehensive quality assurance platform tailored for the hospitality industry to digitize and centralize standards, streamline audits, identify and address issues, and improve guest satisfaction, enabling clients to efficiently define, manage, and audit their service standards.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 19:25:09', '2026-02-03 19:25:10', '2026-02-03 19:25:10'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661210', 'Ferra', 'Ferra', 'Soham Shah', 'Joshua Ford', 'Developer of AI-powered construction estimating software designed for construction professionals and estimating specialists. The company''s software offers features including automated bid estimating workflows, automated takeoff detection for structural components, plan discrepancy identification, and integration with existing enterprise systems, enabling construction teams to improve estimate accuracy, reduce manual effort, and standardize pre-construction costing processes across projects.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 19:34:58', '2026-02-03 19:34:58', '2026-02-03 19:34:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661245', 'PayLater', 'PayLater', 'Soham Shah', 'Mohammed Al-Delaim', 'The company raised $10 million of seed funding from KBN Holding, LuLu Financial Holdings, and Qatar Development Bank on January 29, 2026. The transaction was supported by $ 27.47 million of debt financing. The funds will be used to support sectoral expansion into key verticals such as travel, education, and healthcare, while continuing to strengthen its product offering through the launch of new financial features powered by advanced credit assessment technologies. Previously, the company received an undisclosed amount of financing from LuLu AI, the investment arm of LuLu Financial Holdings, on May 21. 2025. The partnership brings LuLu AI''s regional scale, capital, and fintech expertise to PayLater, enabling the startup to deepen its product offering and scale operations.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 19:36:34', '2026-02-03 19:36:34', '2026-02-03 19:36:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661280', 'Cumulus Labs', 'Cumulus Labs', 'Soham Shah', 'Suryaa Rajinikanth', 'Developer of GPU cloud computing infrastructure designed to offer scalable and cost-efficient compute resources. The company''s platform enables users to specify workload constraints including budget, deadline, and optimization targets, allowing dynamic resource allocation across shared GPU hosts. It provides flexible scaling, provider switching options for better pricing, and a pay-as-you-go model, permitting reduction of idle costs and overprovisioning.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 19:41:34', '2026-02-03 19:41:34', '2026-02-03 19:41:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661308', 'When Insurance', 'When Insurance', 'Soham Shah', 'Andrew Hamilton', 'Developer of offboarding and health insurance navigation systems designed for employers and employees. The company''s artificial intelligence platform provides a streamlined offboarding process, personalized health insurance recommendations, and financial assistance for premiums, enabling businesses to reduce healthcare costs and improve the employee experience during a traditionally stressful transition.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 19:43:23', '2026-02-03 19:43:23', '2026-02-03 19:43:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661343', 'Branded Realities', 'Branded Realities', 'Soham Shah', 'Andrew Hamilton', 'Developer of offboarding and health insurance navigation systems designed for employers and employees. The company''s artificial intelligence platform provides a streamlined offboarding process, personalized health insurance recommendations, and financial assistance for premiums, enabling businesses to reduce healthcare costs and improve the employee experience during a traditionally stressful transition.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 19:45:39', '2026-02-03 19:45:39', '2026-02-03 19:45:39'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661378', 'COMPA', 'COMPA', 'Soham Shah', 'Charlie Franklin', 'Developer of a compensation intelligence platform designed to help organizations manage pay strategies with greater accuracy and alignment. The company''s platform integrates market data with internal systems, continuously updates benchmarks for cash, equity, and hourly wages, and delivers real-time insights tailored to roles and locations, enabling businesses in technology, life sciences, retail, and manufacturing to make informed pay decisions and maintain control over compensation spend.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Soham Shah', 'Source', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 19:48:03', '2026-02-03 19:48:03', '2026-02-03 19:48:03'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661471', 'OrangeTwist', 'OrangeTwist', 'Nakul Ramaswamy', 'Clint Carnell', 'Operator of a network of treatment shops intended to provide aesthetic treatment. The company offers various non-invasive treatments including wrinkle relief, body contouring, skin tightening, rejuvenation and resurfacing, enabling clients to look and feel their best.', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Nakul Ramaswamy', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-05 08:01:21', '2026-02-05 08:01:21', '2026-02-05 08:01:21'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661507', 'The Bardot', 'The Bardot', 'Nakul Ramaswamy', 'Britnye Shore', 'Operator of a beauty company intended to provide women with confidence through on-site beauty experiences. The company offers a variety of bridal makeup services, including signature bridal looks, regional support teams, booking coordination, and flexible roles for freelance professionals for stress-free hair and makeup experiences, enabling brides and their bridesmaids to feel glamorous and unforgettable.', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Nakul Ramaswamy', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-05 08:13:45', '2026-02-05 08:13:45', '2026-02-05 08:13:45'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661542', 'Renatural', 'Renatural', 'Nakul Ramaswamy', 'Aasiyah Abdulsalam', 'Manufacturer of a beauty hardware platform designed to revolutionize wig manufacturing through robotic and biomimetic technology. The company offers an automation system that produces hyper-realistic wigs with scalp-mimicking bases and ethically sourced hair, enabling beauty brands and consumers to access sustainable, high-precision, and inclusive hair products.', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Have not Reached out', 'Nakul Ramaswamy', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-05 08:21:29', '2026-02-05 08:21:30', '2026-02-05 08:21:30'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003661578', 'Facile Skincare', 'Facile Skincare', 'Nakul Ramaswamy', 'Danielle Levy', 'Provider of cosmetic dermatology products intended to help patients explore cosmetic and skincare treatment. The company offers daily essentials, targeted serums, brightening laser treatments, collagen stimulators, and dermal fillers, enabling patients to maintain healthy skin and explore personalized cosmetic care.', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'PitchBook', 'Reached Out', 'Nakul Ramaswamy', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-05 08:25:58', '2026-02-05 08:25:58', '2026-02-05 08:25:58'),
